Package: borealos-apt-skin
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: apt
Maintainer: BorealOS <damarts@borealos.dev>
Description: Boreal-themed visual skin for apt
 A real wrapper around apt for BorealOS. Every command, flag, and
 prompt behaves exactly like stock apt; the wrapper only adds
 boreal-themed coloring on top of the real output by running the
 actual apt binary inside a pseudo-terminal.
 .
 Includes boreal-apt, a small utility to toggle the skin on or off.
